      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-07-11_WidnesExaminer_art0074" n="art0074">
        <head>EXAMINER, SATURDAY, JULY 11, 1896.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, JULY 11, 1896.</p>
        <p>IMPORTANT QUESTIONS TO THE PUBLIC.</p>
